	(text "Switch J16:\n\nFloat → OFF\nGND → ON (~46mA, no load)\n\nR28 (330Ω) limits LVD gate inrush\n10kΩ on pin 2 required - no series resistor on D11, direct short will destroy it\nTODO rev: add series resistor in series with D11 cathode to source to limit zener current\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130.048 72.898 0)
		(effects
